{\fs22\b Welcome to SpaceSharp}\par\par
SpaceSharp shows a drive or folder as a map where every file and folder is a box sized by the space it uses, so the biggest ones stand out at once. Double-click to zoom into a folder, scroll to zoom back out, and tidy up straight from the map.\par\par
This wizard installs SpaceSharp on your computer. You can choose the folder and whether to install it for yourself or for everyone who uses this PC.\par\par
SpaceSharp keeps itself up to date: when a new version is released it offers to install it, and the update takes a few seconds.\par\par
